# Approval Center — Premium Experience

## Primary content

The approval decision is the main content. Do not render internal phase/program/roadmap copy in ordinary customer tenants:

- Phase / Fase success criteria
- Self Love (A.76)
- Human Oversight Engine (A.40)
- Secure AI Actions / Trust Phase labels
- Governance & Policy program codes
- Action Center (AEF) as primary UI
- English philosophy/mission blocks from RPC meta

Hide such meta unless an explicit Platform/Super internal flag is on.

## Layout

- Desktop-first wide shell: ~`max-w-[1560px]`, not a narrow `max-w-4xl` column
- Selected approval: main column + sticky decision panel
- Mobile: one column, sticky bottom actions
- Technical IDs live under collapsed **Technical details**

## One view model

Use `buildApprovalViewModel()` / helpers in `lib/companion-action-approval/presentation.ts` for:

- title, summary, status, risk, role, source, dates, what changes / unchanged

No parallel raw status/risk/role switches in components. No CSS `capitalize` as i18n.

## Surfaces

ECC, Approval Center list/detail, Kompis cards, briefing, and counts must share the same approval ID, status, risk, title, and source presentation.

## Decisions

Do not change CORE.APPROVAL authority, bindings, checksum, single-use, or decision semantics in UI tasks. Sticky Approve/Reject must respect existing safety gates.

## Forbidden

- UnoNight hardcoding
- Browser/session/MFA handling in this surface
- Live publish/rollback inside presentation tasks
